# Built binaries at repo root — anchored so we don't accidentally
# ignore `cmd/xerotty-viewer/`, themes named after these, etc.
/xerotty
/xerottyd
/xerotty-viewer
/xerotty.app
/xerotty-sdl3-spike
/iterm2-import
imgui.ini

# Icon build intermediates — checked-in artifacts are icon/xerotty.svg
# (source), icon/xerotty.icns (macOS bundle, built via `make icns`),
# and icon/xerotty-256.png (Linux runtime icon, embedded via go:embed
# in internal/app/icon_linux.go).
icon/xerotty.iconset/
icon/xerotty-*.png
!icon/xerotty-256.png
